# Example requests. Use an HTTP client that supports .http files (VS Code REST Client, JetBrains),
# or copy each request into curl.
@backend = http://localhost:3000
@crm = http://localhost:4002
@fake = http://localhost:4003

### --- Supplied mock CRM (node backend/mock-crm.mjs) ---

### Mapped metadata
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9001

### Requested account is not first in the CRM's list
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9002

### Empty account: zeros stay zeros
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-EMPTY

### Unknown account -> 404
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/UNKNOWN

### Invalid id -> 400, CRM is not called
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/bad%20id

### Echo a caller-supplied request id
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9001
X-Request-ID: my-trace-123

### Liveness / readiness
GET {{backend}}/health

###
GET {{backend}}/health/ready

### Set the mock's global mode: ok | auto | error | timeout | missing | nested
POST {{crm}}/__control
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "timeout" }

### Inspect mock call counts
GET {{crm}}/__stats

### --- Scenario fake CRM (python scripts/fake_crm.py; backend started with CRM_BASE_URL={{fake}}) ---

### List scenarios
GET {{fake}}/__scenarios

### Pick a scenario, then call {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9001
POST {{fake}}/__control
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scenario": "invalid_number_types" }

### Make every CRM call slow (backend should return 504 after 3s)
POST {{fake}}/__control
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scenario": "ok_p9001", "slow_ms": 4000 }

### Force a CRM status code (503 is retried once; 500 is not)
POST {{fake}}/__control
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scenario": "ok_p9001", "slow_ms": 0, "status": 503 }

### Reset
POST {{fake}}/__control
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scenario": "ok_p9001", "slow_ms": 0, "status": null }

### --- Task 3: performance history (run node backend/fixtures/generate-history.mjs first; no CRM needed) ---

### Last day: 2 points, yesterday and today
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9001/performance-history?range=1D

### Year to date: from January 1
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9001/performance-history?range=YTD

### No range means All (401 days)
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9001/performance-history

### Less history than the range: all 60 days, no padding
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9002/performance-history?range=1Y

### Portfolio with no history -> []
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-EMPTY/performance-history

### Invalid range -> 400 invalid_range (no silent default)
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/P-9001/performance-history?range=1W

### Unknown portfolio -> 404
GET {{backend}}/portfolios/UNKNOWN/performance-history
